AND ALONE COMPLEX","ratingNum":9.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 动画片\n好于 97% 动作片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1993326737.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,犯罪","address":" 日本","years":"2002","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2152986981.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2403609225.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2459688570.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2177510601.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2152987732.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1993326737.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2869044512.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1662567331.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1666103230.webp\"]","descs":"《攻壳机动队》动画TV版，分2季。\n　　第一季描述：公元2030年，经历了4次世界大战的世界面临更严峻的挑战。随着人类义体化等科技的不断发展，犯罪行为也日渐离奇复杂。为了解决这类案件，日本内务省的直属部队——公安9课，这个对外不存在的特种部队，在队长草薙素子的带领下向恶势力 发起制裁。而面对公安9课的，是高度发达的科技下创造的案件、权力政治斗争的阴谋、与以笑脸男为代表的Stand Alone Complex犯罪。\n　　第二季故事发生在笑脸男事件结束后，公安9课面对了新的敌人，自称“个人的11人”的反政府武装组织开始了计划周密的犯罪，其背后牵扯的战争难民问题更令整个社会的矛盾激化。面对政府与犯罪分子带来的压力，草薙素子再次带领公安9课出动。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1s0UtXTm-VwROW3W_OrrB9Q?pwd=7q2i\",\"size\":\"5.26\",\"date\":\"2025-06-14\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":268,"title":"无间道 無間道","ratingNum":9.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 犯罪片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2564556863.webp","tag":"No.18豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国香港","years":"2002","date":"2003-09-05(中国大陆)、2002-12-12(中国香港)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1182116984.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581669417.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2228754233.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p462575438.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2018065659.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2564556863.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p462573649.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1323019785.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2501417895.webp\"]","descs":"1991年，香港黑帮三合会会员刘健明（刘德华）听从老大韩琛（曾志伟）的吩咐，加入警察部队成为黑帮卧底，韩琛许诺刘健明会帮其在七年后晋升为见习督察。1992年，警察训练学校优秀学员陈永仁（梁朝伟）被上级要求深入到三合会做卧底，终极目标是成为韩琛身边的红人。2002年，两人都不负重望，也都身背重压，刘健明渐想成为一个真正的好人，陈永仁则盼着尽快回归警察身份。\n　　重案组从陈永仁手中获悉一批毒品交易情报，锁紧目标人物韩琛，没料情报被刘健明泄出，双方行动均告失败。但此事将双方均有卧底的事实暴露，引发双方高层清除内鬼的决心。命运迥异又相似的刘健明和陈永仁开始在无间道的旅程中接受严峻考验。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1GwQvoaJkez_WJpOphuEC7w?pwd=3xa6\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-14\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":491,"title":"泰国洞穴救援","ratingNum":9.1,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2680301852.webp","tag":"惊悚","address":" 美国","years":"2021","date":"","photos":null,"descs":"本片讲述了2018年被困在泰国洞穴中的野猪青年足球队以及他们最终被救援的戏剧性故事。凭借独家访问权限和前所未见的救援镜头，这部电影讲述了洞穴潜水员的故事，他们挑战了人类潜力的极限，并成就了一个生动人心魄的英雄们赌上生命的故事。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ar2PEJaVL2Yn0_ChqntymQ?pwd=5wvy\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":692,"title":"禁闭岛 Shutter Island","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 悬疑片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p450262388.webp","tag":"No.82豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"2010","date":"2010-02-13(柏林电影节)、2010-02-19(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.