3385941.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p983905835.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p983905531.webp\"]","descs":"影片是根据真人真事改编的，K19是苏联第一艘战略核潜艇。\n　　影片导演凯瑟琳·毕格罗是首位奥斯卡最佳女导演奖获得者。\n　　亚里克西（哈里森·福特 Harrison Ford 饰）船长，在冷战最为紧张的时刻接到命令接替原船长米克黑尔（ 连姆·尼森 Liam Neeson 饰）出任核动力导弹潜艇K-19的指挥官。亚里克西的任务是不惜一切代价，尽快将这艘维护不当的潜艇投入作战戒备，执行其处女航行。但是两人和全艇忠诚的官兵们压根也没想到他们会去执行什么任务。他们也无法料想到失败的代价对于他们以及全世界会意味着什么。那时，一个核反应堆发生故障，一个危险的燃料棒即将溶融、发生核爆炸，这将肯定使艇上所有人员葬身海底。当时他们在北冰洋底游弋，是全体船员们的勇敢，以及船长对国家和对船员们的职责感最终挽救了K-19，避免了一场即将发生的核灾难。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1XNDsCK4D4_BrYV6Zg33j4w?pwd=u3se\",\"size\":\"2.07\",\"date\":\"2025-09-28\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1572,"title":"铁血战士：杀戮之王 Predator: Killer of Killers","ratingNum":7.8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 77% 动作片\n好于 84% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2921714294.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2025","date":"2025-06-06(美国网络)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714299.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714297.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714295.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714296.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714298.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921714294.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2921910009.webp\"]","descs":"故事跨越时空，从维京时代到幕府日本至二战时期，讲述三个铁血战士的勇猛事迹。人类的宿命是否将从此改写？","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1PQ_0c-skDJLSO_N4fH3x3Q?pwd=8rik\",\"size\":\"1.91\",\"date\":\"2025-10-11\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1550,"title":"罪人 Sinners","ratingNum":7.7,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 83% 剧情片\n好